&lt;p&gt;You’re an experienced sales professional who can build value in competitive situations and explain complex products clearly. You’re equally comfortable working with customers and internal stakeholders, excited to become a product expert, and willing to share what you learn. You’re organised, analytical, and proactive, with a track record of improving the processes and teams around you.&lt;/p&gt;
