&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive on the Platforms team, focused on existing business, you will use sales and product expertise to drive growth with existing Stripe users. You will help customers understand how Stripe’s online commerce infrastructure can make payments a competitive advantage for their businesses. These customers include innovative, fast-growing software platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow a named account list. Develop account plans to win and expand business with upper middle market and enterprise companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with C-level executives, and coordinate the right executive touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Stripe’s platform partnership strategy, repeatable processes, and scaled engagement models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop outbound strategies to create and nurture opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle, from lead generation through close, for upper middle market and enterprise companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders at new and existing clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders across Engineering, Product, and Finance to lead complex product workshops and financial analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and contribute to team projects that develop and refine the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering teams to inform product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
