&lt;p&gt;You can work effectively in competitive situations that require product and technical knowledge. You are analytical, can model business outcomes and quantify return on investment, and are comfortable prospecting and owning deals from start to finish. You also enjoy building sales processes, strengthening value propositions, and creating practical sales tools and assets.&lt;/p&gt;
