&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s Alliances and Channels (A&amp;amp;C) team supports platform partners that embed Stripe technology in their solutions. As a Channel Sales Executive (CSE), you will help build demand and create growth opportunities across Stripe’s partner ecosystem.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You will drive business growth across a portfolio of software-as-a-service (SaaS) platforms. You will identify high-value opportunities, develop demand with platform partners, and build new business within the partner ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Partner Development Managers and Stripe Account Executives, you will drive growth in new users and revenue across your portfolio. You will help Stripe and its partners establish joint value propositions, identify shared account opportunities, and move opportunities through the deal cycle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
