&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with platform counterparts to generate net-new demand for partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Stripe and partner sales teams on the joint value proposition, and lead account-mapping workshops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute sales strategies to expand Stripe revenue with strategic platforms&lt;/li&gt;
