&lt;p&gt;The Demand Generation Manager, Startups, APAC will be the day-to-day demand generation lead for the Startup segment in the region. This person will translate global Startup priorities into an integrated APAC plan, build regionally relevant programs, and independently lead cross-functional execution across channels and markets. The role will connect regional market insight with global strategy and use data to improve how Stripe reaches, engages, and converts startups across their growth journey.&lt;/p&gt;
