&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of engineering management experience, directly managing and growing teams of 5+ engineers building and shipping products at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of full-time software development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable, extensible software that supports a range of user needs, with strong user empathy and a commitment to high-quality user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, with a track record of finding practical solutions to complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning ambiguous goals into clear priorities and delivering multiple high-impact workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building a supportive environment with candid feedback and high expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
