&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s New Zealand business is growing, and we are building our enterprise new-business capability in the market. The Enterprise team focuses on winning and developing relationships with New Zealand’s largest and most strategic companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive, New Business, you will establish and grow a new enterprise territory. You will identify must-win accounts, build a high-conviction pipeline, develop executive relationships, and lead complex sales cycles that help prospective users use Stripe to modernise and grow their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory strategy for New Zealand’s largest prospective enterprise users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create new pipeline through thoughtful outbound prospecting, account research, partner engagement, executive networking, and targeted account plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full new-business sales cycle, from initial outreach and discovery through solution design, commercial negotiation, close, and transition to implementation and post-sales teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with senior business and technical stakeholders, including leaders across Finance, Product, Engineering, Operations, Digital, and Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-threaded sales processes involving multiple business units, decision-makers, and internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate Stripe’s business and technical value across the platform, connecting customer priorities to measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Solutions Architects, Product, Partnerships, Marketing, Legal, Deal Pricing, and post-sales teams to develop and close strategic opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial negotiations for complex and bespoke agreements while protecting long-term customer value and Stripe economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build account plans, mutual action plans, financial analyses, and executive-level presentations that advance opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish and refine Stripe’s enterprise sales motion in New Zealand by sharing market insight, improving messaging, and contributing to repeatable sales practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a high-performing enterprise seller who thrives in new-business environments. You know how to open doors at large organisations, earn credibility with senior stakeholders, and lead complex sales cycles from ambiguity to a clear commercial outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are commercially rigorous, technically curious, and persistent. You can balance strategic account planning with the day-to-day discipline needed to build pipeline and maintain momentum across long sales cycles. You are comfortable operating with autonomy and enjoy building a territory where there is substantial opportunity to define the playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
