&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a proven ability to build relationships with and influence business partners and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with a hands-on mindset, able to bring structure to ambiguous areas, thrive in fast-moving environments, and maintain high performance under tight timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
