&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack capabilities; comfortable writing code on core Stripe systems while also understanding external partner systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in a modern web stack and have shipped production level code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding and ability to read the code/interfaces of partner systems (e.g., Salesforce, Oracle, Netsuite) to facilitate complex integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable, intuitive, and capable of quickly solving complex, multi-system problems.&lt;/li&gt;
