&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in GTM leadership, sales enablement, sales effectiveness, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing a team in a complex, high-growth organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling enablement programs or business-partner models across multiple regions, segments, or GTM roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building prioritization and operating models, influencing senior stakeholders, and leading complex cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using performance data to identify skill gaps, guide coaching, and connect enablement to proficiency, behavior, and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
