&lt;li&gt;Experience in a quota-carrying sales or sales leadership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience enabling global teams and adapting programs across regions, markets, and cultural contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading organizational change involving sales methodologies, processes, tools, or operating models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using artificial intelligence and automation to improve enablement delivery, personalization, reporting, or operational effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
