&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in partnerships, business development, account management, or a comparable cross-functional role, with demonstrated ownership of external relationships and measurable business outcomes; experience managing a broad portfolio through scalable programs, engagement models, partner lifecycle activities, or enablement, and contributing to program improvements&lt;/li&gt;
