&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Programs, People Development, Talent &amp;amp; Careers, Global Mobility, Total Rewards, Recruiting, Inclusion and Diversity and People Ops to develop programs that continually elevate the caliber and kindness of Stripes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
