&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in a strategy, business operations, or highly analytical role at a technology company, or similar experience in management consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
