&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Business Value Consulting and Proposals team supports long-term growth and value creation for Stripe’s largest and most strategic users. We translate Stripe&#39;s technical capabilities into measurable business outcomes and create value-led proposals that help secure and expand relationships with leading organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Proposal Lead, you’ll manage requests for proposals and requests for information (RFPs and RFIs) for Stripe’s largest pursuits. You’ll develop proposal strategy and narratives, coordinate contributors across Stripe, and deliver high-quality submissions that address customer requirements. You’ll also improve the processes, templates, and tools that help Stripe manage proposals consistently and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring structure to complex pursuits, build trusted relationships, and communicate clearly with contributors and leaders. This role is a good fit for someone who can balance strategic thinking with detailed execution while managing multiple deadlines and priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end bid management process, including reviewing bid invitations, supporting bid or no-bid analysis, defining the response strategy, and establishing timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customers’ business and technical requirements into clear, persuasive proposals that communicate Stripe’s value and competitive advantages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop proposal content, including executive summaries, value propositions, and recommendations related to pricing and commercial structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate contributors across sales, solutions architecture, legal, privacy, security, and other functions to produce complete and accurate responses to bid components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead proposal reviews, resolve blockers, and keep contributors aligned to deliver high-quality submissions within required timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop proposals that connect customer requirements with Stripe’s long-term goals, products, and capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve proposal processes, templates, tools, and performance reporting, using win and loss data to identify opportunities for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in bid management, deal management, procurement, pricing strategy, financial consulting, legal services, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex, large-scale bids from initial evaluation through submission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proposal writing and project management skills, with a clear understanding of the bid and deal lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating cross-functional contributors and communicating effectively with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with payments or software-as-a-service (SaaS) products and improving processes in an ambiguous environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with bid management software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of pricing and commercial strategies used in proposal development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating the value of complex payments products and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program Management Professional (PgMP) or Project Management Professional (PMP) certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Government Relations &amp;amp; Public Affairs team represents Stripe to governments, regulators, industry partners, and broader stakeholder audiences. We help the company understand and adapt to a changing global policy environment, anticipate and respond to challenges, and advocate for the needs of our users and the online economy. The team works closely with Policy Strategy, Legal, Communications, Marketing, and regional product and go-to-market teams to ensure coordinated, consistent engagement worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is looking for a Public Affairs Campaigns Lead to build our profile in the policy landscape across EMEA, with a particular focus on the EU, its Member States, and the UK. Working closely with colleagues in Government Relations, Communications and Marketing, you will help turn Stripe’s policy priorities into compelling campaigns, develop thought leadership, and deliver policy events that reach the right audiences and shape the conversation. This person will be a truly great campaigns operative, someone willing to roll up their sleeves and who prides themselves on executing with excellence. You will help make Stripe’s ideas and expertise, and our users’ experiences, more visible and impactful - building a distinctive, credible voice for Stripe among policymakers and the wider policy community. If you are up for the challenge, we would love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Help develop and deliver public affairs campaigns that advance Stripe’s policy priorities across EMEA, taking campaigns from idea to execution, with clear objectives, target audiences, messages and tactics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Develop thought leadership that shapes the debate, including distinctive reports, commentary and campaign content that draws on Stripe’s expertise, data and users’ experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Deliver policy events with lasting impact, putting Stripe and our users in front of those who create the policy landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work with Government Relations and Policy Strategy colleagues to translate complex issues into compelling narratives and campaign materials that give policymakers a reason to pay attention.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bring the right channels and partners together to extend campaigns’ reach and influence, working with Government Relations colleagues as well as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Communications, Marketing, industry groups, think tanks and users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build Stripe’s policy brand by connecting individual campaigns, publications and events into a recognisable, credible voice in the region’s policy conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of Stripe’s global public affairs campaigns capability, working closely with Public Affairs colleagues in the US and across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Minimum 3+ years of experience in public policy, public affairs, campaigning, government relations, communications, advocacy, or related fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience executing political or advocacy campaigns, building coalitions, coordinating stakeholders, and delivering events with impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excellence in execution, someone able to move at speed to deliver incredible events, compelling content and impactful campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A terrific communicator and writer, fluent in English and adept at producing compelling thought leadership and campaign materials, clear briefings and impactful short-form messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interest in and understanding of policy, government affairs, and the tech and/or payments ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable working with cross-functional partners and in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven collaborator who is resourceful, execution-oriented, and able to work both independently and as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel frequently for meetings and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passionate about Stripe’s mission of helping ambitious businesses grow and thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Empathy, humility, and some comedy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Professional experience and existing relationships within the EU and/or UK policy and public affairs ecosystems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting global or multi‑jurisdictional public affairs campaigns, including adapting and deploying global messaging and playbooks for local audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Background or advocacy in technology, financial services, or related sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Language skills beyond English are an advantage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to shape global public affairs campaigns and programmes at a fast-growing company touching millions of businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, mission-driven Government Relations &amp;amp; Public Affairs team that works closely with Policy Strategy, Legal, Communications, and Marketing around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and to take on increasing responsibility across global programmes.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual salary range for this role in London is £91,200 to £136,800.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is building economic infrastructure for the internet. We help organizations of every size move money, manage revenue, and build global financial services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Public Sector team builds Stripe’s presence in markets where organizations deliver essential services to millions of people. In the UK, public sector organizations collect taxes and tuition, enable transit, distribute funds, support charitable giving, and modernize citizen services. The team helps these organizations improve how they collect, manage, and disburse funds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the UK Public Sector Lead, you will build and lead Stripe’s public sector go-to-market motion in the UK. You will define how Stripe serves central government, local government, devolved administrations, public bodies, higher education, utilities, transport, charities and not-for-profit organizations, and adjacent regulated organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine market knowledge, commercial judgment, and operational leadership to build trusted relationships, win meaningful business, and establish the operating model needed to serve public sector customers. This role reports to the Global Head of Public Sector and will help launch Stripe’s UK public sector motion in 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define Stripe’s UK public sector strategy, including priority segments, customer problems,&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; routes to market, commercial opportunities, and the capabilities needed to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships across government, public bodies, procurement ecosystems, industry associations, systems integrators, and advisory partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior customer decision-makers to understand their payment, revenue, digital service, and financial infrastructure needs, and develop solutions with Stripe teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide strategic opportunities through public sector procurement, contracting, security, compliance, and stakeholder alignment requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal, Compliance, Risk, Go-to-Market, Alliances and Channels, Product, Engineering, Finance, and Operations to prepare Stripe to support public sector customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn recurring market requirements into priorities for onboarding, risk, contracting, procurement, implementation, support, and product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the positioning, account strategy, partner ecosystem, sales plays, internal processes, and success metrics that support growth in the UK and inform Stripe’s global public sector strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
