&lt;p&gt;As Sales Manager, Enterprise — LATAM, you’ll recruit, coach, and lead a team responsible for developing new strategic relationships and expanding Stripe’s footprint within existing enterprise users. You’ll combine strong people leadership with hands-on deal coaching, disciplined business management, and a deep understanding of the Brazilian market.&lt;/p&gt;
