&lt;li&gt;Strong business-management skills, including pipeline inspection, forecasting, performance management, and operating cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in both Portuguese and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, influence, and stakeholder-management skills with senior audiences, in person and virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in an ambiguous, high-growth, technology-forward environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work from Stripe’s Sao Paulo office in accordance with the team’s in-office expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
