&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to uncover the deepest levels of customer pain and desired outcomes, going beyond surface-level requirements. By truly understanding their strategic business objectives, you will architect and tailor Stripe&#39;s solutions as the definitive answer to their most pressing challenges. You will be instrumental in mapping the customer&#39;s transformation journey, crafting future-state roadmaps and solution architectures that inherently factor in complex third-party integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
