&lt;li&gt;Execute meticulous technical discovery, conducting in-depth business analysis and background research on customer operations, industry dynamics, and competitive landscapes to build a foundational understanding that informs every proposed solution. This goes beyond fact-finding; it&#39;s about understanding their &quot;why.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic engagements, guiding Korea users through a structured discovery process to align with their core business priorities. You will design compelling, technically sound solutions and master the &quot;technical win&quot; by evangelizing these proposals through executive briefings, comprehensive readouts, tailored presentations, and impactful solution demonstrations that resonate with the customer&#39;s specific challenges and desired future state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and articulate expansion opportunities, strategically extending Stripe’s footprint within existing accounts into new global markets and business units. This involves introducing new capabilities and local payment methods, always with a clear focus on the technical feasibility and the value delivered at each touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the &quot;Voice of the Customer&quot; within Stripe&#39;s product and engineering teams, meticulously capturing insights, emerging trends, and new opportunities from the field. You will champion these requirements, ensuring they are accurately prioritized and inform future product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the critical technical counterpoint to the sales executive, providing invaluable technical insight and designing robust solutions for both prospective and existing platform users. You will be the expert guide on Stripe&#39;s technical merits and strategic benefits for both platforms and their end-user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Craft and deliver compelling technical demonstrations that don&#39;t just show features, but powerfully showcase how Stripe&#39;s platform solves specific business problems, highlighting the unique value proposition, key differentiators, and potential for customization. Crucially, you will illustrate how these benefits cascade directly to the customer&#39;s own user base, driving their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
