&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re capable of engaging in both business-level and technical conversations at multiple levels of a customer organization, including finance, data, and engineering leadership. You enjoy working on products that require deep technical understanding combined with business context, and you&#39;re as comfortable in a warehouse schema as you are in a revenue conversation with a CFO. You&#39;re excited to become an expert and to share that knowledge broadly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet the minimum requirements below, we encourage you to apply — the preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
