&lt;li&gt;Design alerting systems using existing tools to respond to incidents quickly, or prevent them altogether.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct data analysis to understand the impact of risk and compliance interventions on the users and surface future product opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
