&lt;p&gt;Must have a Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Computer Science, Information systems, Engineering, or a related field, plus 2 years of experience in Technical or technical user-facing roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have 2 years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developer tools including git;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting and automation skills including Ruby and Python;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Writing tooling and automation, including testing and idempotency;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Observability tooling including metrics (Prometheus, Datadog), logging (LogScale), and distributed tracing (Honeycomb);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident response, on-call rotations, runbooks, and postmortem processes; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using SQL and relational databases including PostgreSQL or MySQL for operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $137,000.00 - $205,600.00 /yr.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions/sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
